---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="关于我">
  <div class="about">
    <div class="about-deco-top">★ ♥ ✿ ♪ ★</div>
    <div class="about-avatar">
      <img src="/avatar.jpg" alt="头像" />
    </div>
    <h1>★ 关于我 ★</h1>
    <div class="about-content prose">
      <p>你好，欢迎来到「一帧.life」。♡</p>
      <p>我叫吴承晓，一名大三学生，热爱并沉迷于打羽毛球，也在断断续续学习知识，准备后面找工作。</p>
      <p>这个博客是我的小小天地，记录技术学习的思考，平常的生活点滴，生活中的所见所感。</p>
      <p>★ 世界那么大，我先溜达溜达。★</p>
    </div>
    <div class="about-stamps">
      <span class="stamp stamp-1">★ 技术宅</span>
      <span class="stamp stamp-2">♥ 羽毛球</span>
      <span class="stamp stamp-3">✿ 生活家</span>
    </div>
    <div class="about-deco-bottom">△ ○ △ ○ △ ○ △</div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about {
    max-width: var(--max-width);
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .about-deco-top {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--deco-yellow);
    animation: twinkle 2s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  .about-avatar {
    margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
  }

  .about-avatar img {
    width: 120px;
    height: 120px;
    object-fit: cover;
    border: 4px solid var(--deco-yellow);
    clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 100% 25%, 100% 75%, 50% 100%, 0% 75%, 0% 25%);
  }

  .about h1 {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    color: var(--deco-yellow);
    text-shadow: 2px 2px 0 var(--deco-red);
  }

  .about-content {
    text-align: left;
    border: none;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    background: var(--bg-card);
  }

  .about-stamps {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.8rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .stamp {
    padding: 0.5em 1.2em;
    border-radius: 0;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    border: 3px solid;
  }

  .stamp-1 {
    background: var(--deco-blue);
    color: #ffffff;
    border-color: var(--deco-blue);
    transform: rotate(-4deg);
  }

  .stamp-2 {
    background: var(--deco-red);
    color: #ffffff;
    border-color: var(--deco-red);
    transform: rotate(3deg);
  }

  .stamp-3 {
    background: var(--deco-green);
    color: #000000;
    border-color: var(--deco-green);
    transform: rotate(-2deg);
  }

  .about-deco-bottom {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--deco-blue);
    opacity: 0.5;
  }

  @keyframes twinkle {
    0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
    50% { opacity: 0.5; }
  }
</style>
